WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
- Hi, we should be under America’s Team.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.166
 - Um...the Lions?

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:04.750
- What?! No, the Cowboys.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.083
- Oh, yes. Welcome to the Pari-TEA Party!

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:09.250
- It's pretty bright. Can I get some protection?
- No.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.250
- Now remember, you're not supposed to blow it.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.875
- [Herbert, Ekeler:] OHHH!

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:14.791
- [CMC:] We're here because we lost three in a row.

00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:16.750
You see, 'parity' means there's little difference

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.375
between the quality of these teams.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.958
Do I have to do everything?

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:21.250
- Not my first tea party.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.500
- There's been a mistake.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.375
We're um... kind of a tier up from these lower class teams.

00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:27.916
- Your finger sandwiches.

00:00:27.916 --> 00:00:30.500
- Woo! Not the first finger I've eaten and it won't be the last.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.416
- But there's nothing better than parity.

00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:33.750
Just ask the NFC South.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:37.000
- So then they got Ridder him
and went with me.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.250
[Kamara, Heinicke, Mayfield chuckle]

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:40.250
- Why are you here? You only have two losses.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.000
- Yes, but we’re the Jags.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.833
And God's plan is for us to just be okay.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.750
- What a treat to share all these Zac Snacks,
with y'all.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.875
Yes, even you.

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:49.625
The disgusting
distraction from the Browns.

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:50.750
- Ahahaha!

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:54.291
- We tried the whole being elite thing, but it was just so hard.

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:55.375
To Parity!

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.958
- [Jerry:] Roger. We don't pay you $65 million a year

00:00:57.958 --> 00:00:59.208
to be treated like this.

00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:00.125
- I'm sorry, how much?

00:01:00.375 --> 00:01:02.000
- Get them, mid-season replacements!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.125
- DAKKY, run!

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.166
- Not really our strong suit this year, Mr. Jones!

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:06.958
- [Dak:] Wait, who are you guys?

00:01:10.041 --> 00:01:11.125
- Oh thank god, the Bills.

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:13.333
- [Josh:] You can't fall short of expectations...

00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:14.541
- if there aren’t any.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.500
- Oh sweet baby muskrat!

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.125
Even the Bills are just okay!

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:20.875
[chanting:] PARITY. PARITY.

00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:22.708
- Take Dakky, not me.

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:25.125
- Ah, is that Jesus Christ?!?!

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:26.916
- Close. It's Jalen Hurts.

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:27.750
Take my hand.

00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:29.625
Oops!
- [Jerry:] Ahhh!

00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:32.000
They really should ban that brotherly shove.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.583
- Why, Eagles, Whyyyyyyyyyyy?!

00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:39.583
- Alvin, you know what I'm talking about.

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.083
You’re no stranger to a tussle.

00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:41.625
[chuckles]

00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:43.083
- Oh, you're bad, Taylor.

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:45.458
Now, I'll tell you what's going on between Olave and Carr.

00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:47.250
But I don't think you're ready for THAT tea. 

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.458
- Ohhh, child/He's got some gumption, don't he/I'll pay his fine.  

00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:52.458
- Why the f--k are you all talking like that?

